{"id": 18, "ok": true, "cmd": "limit", "ucas": "limit (1+1/n)^n as n -> (inf)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "limit", "var": "n", "at": "inf", "side": "both", "limit": {"kind": "number", "value": 2.718281828459045, "text": "2.718281828"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "numeric_left", "points": 22, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "Richardson-extrapolated values approaching the point"}], "files": [], "text": "limit of (1/n + 1)^n as n -> inf:\n  (1/n + 1)^n = exp((n)*log(1/n + 1))\n  0*inf: n*log(1/n + 1) = (log(1/n + 1))/(1/n)\n  0/0: L'Hôpital: lim (-1/(n^2*(1/n + 1)))/(-1/n^2) = lim n^2/(n^2*(1/n + 1))\n  at inf: n^2 ~ 1|n|^2, n^2*(1/n + 1) ~ 1|n|^2\n  = 2.718281828\n  numeric (x = 10*2^k, k = 0..21): 2.59374246, 2.709835576, 2.717751104, 2.718248647, 2.718279755, 2.718281764\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 2.71828182846 (estimated error 3e-16): agrees\n"}
